1
00:00:00,283 --> 00:00:04,871
Imagine three managers copying the same Salesforce information into separate

2
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:05,969
weekly reports.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,371
The immediate temptation is to automate all three.

4
00:00:09,768 --> 00:00:13,054
First ask which decisions the reports support and whether they

5
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:14,036
repeat each other.

6
00:00:15,103 --> 00:00:20,093
Axios leadership’s published simplification framework asks people to confront priorities,

7
00:00:20,412 --> 00:00:24,474
remove unnecessary work, and amplify what matters.

8
00:00:24,794 --> 00:00:29,201
In our illustration, two overlapping reports collapse into one shared

9
00:00:29,201 --> 00:00:31,652
view before any new automation is built.

10
00:00:32,693 --> 00:00:37,416
After simplification, compare a process change, a standard platform rule,

11
00:00:37,719 --> 00:00:39,278
and an AI assistant.

12
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:42,633
Predictable work may need only a simple rule.

13
00:00:42,961 --> 00:00:46,584
More complexity is justified when the additional value outweighs its

14
00:00:46,584 --> 00:00:48,462
costs and failure risks.

15
00:00:49,506 --> 00:00:51,777
The source describes two broad pressures:

16
00:00:52,303 --> 00:00:56,748
AI answers may reduce visits to publishers, while content licensing

17
00:00:56,748 --> 00:00:58,787
can create commercial opportunities.

18
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:01,570
These are evolving business relationships.

19
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:06,362
Specific partnership and financial claims should retain dates and primary-source

20
00:01:06,362 --> 00:01:07,176
attribution.

21
00:01:08,226 --> 00:01:12,497
An approved AI tool might draft requirements, summarize issues, or

22
00:01:12,497 --> 00:01:14,074
suggest test cases.

23
00:01:14,398 --> 00:01:16,587
The analyst verifies its output.

24
00:01:16,976 --> 00:01:21,690
Confidential commercial records belong only in authorized services, and required

25
00:01:21,690 --> 00:01:24,335
human approvals remain part of the workflow.

26
00:01:25,373 --> 00:01:30,428
A useful proposal identifies the business problem, expected benefit, cost,

27
00:01:30,812 --> 00:01:33,739
owner, controls, and success measure.

28
00:01:34,059 --> 00:01:36,948
Your Salesforce responsibilities still come first.

29
00:01:37,268 --> 00:01:39,461
AI literacy strengthens that work;

30
00:01:39,884 --> 00:01:42,747
it does not automatically turn the position into a separate

31
00:01:42,783 --> 00:01:43,662
AI role.
